WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.519 --> 01:46.904
=Episode 1=
(Exchanging Names Made Us Friends)

01:48.807 --> 01:50.167
(Hello, Mr. Qu.)

01:50.887 --> 01:51.568
(Xu Zhi.)

01:52.328 --> 01:53.887
(With your estimated score,)

01:54.048 --> 01:56.447
(it's a pity to go
to the local Qingyi University.)

01:58.040 --> 01:59.736
(But it is a real pity for Tan Xu.)

01:59.736 --> 02:01.608
(Yifeng Alley)
(He may repeat a year,)

02:02.167 --> 02:04.048
(as he can't get
into a first-tier university.)

02:04.408 --> 02:06.807
(Try to cheer him up
if you get a chance.)

02:07.848 --> 02:08.407
(Okay.)

02:09.008 --> 02:09.928
Tan Xu.

02:12.247 --> 02:13.288
Tan Xu.

02:25.888 --> 02:27.608
Hello, the number you have dialed...

02:34.888 --> 02:38.048
Tan Xu, let's meet
and talk in person tomorrow.

02:44.888 --> 02:47.367
I told you. She's not my girlfriend.

02:47.728 --> 02:48.728
Stop lying.

02:49.328 --> 02:51.728
Chen Luzhou, can you stop
making me worried?

02:56.407 --> 02:57.607
(Stop lying.)

02:57.687 --> 03:01.048
(Xu Zhi, can you stop
making me worried?)

03:01.527 --> 03:04.407
(Why does she sound
so much like my mom?)

03:06.288 --> 03:08.008
If I hadn't come today,

03:08.687 --> 03:09.967
what would you have done?

03:11.288 --> 03:13.167
I don't forbid you from dating.

03:13.247 --> 03:13.968
But don't

03:14.048 --> 03:15.447
leave me a huge mess

03:15.527 --> 03:16.768
to clean up.

03:17.288 --> 03:18.208
Isn't that perfect?

03:18.608 --> 03:19.807
You won't have to try

03:19.888 --> 03:20.608
to send me abroad.

03:21.687 --> 03:23.768
Do you have to be so mean?

03:24.087 --> 03:25.167
You weren't like this

03:25.247 --> 03:26.488
when you first came.

03:26.847 --> 03:27.928
Anyway,

03:28.127 --> 03:30.368
you have to sort everything out

03:30.448 --> 03:31.448
before going abroad.

03:31.888 --> 03:33.687
You're giving me a stomachache.

03:46.599 --> 03:47.768
(Qingyi No.1 High School)

03:47.928 --> 03:49.208
(No. 1 High School?)

03:52.567 --> 03:53.448
Add me on WeChat.

03:55.807 --> 03:57.287
Text me when you want to hear me

03:57.367 --> 03:58.328
get scolded again.

03:58.768 --> 04:00.208
I will put a chair out there.

04:01.527 --> 04:02.608
Isn't it tiring

04:03.247 --> 04:03.928
to stand here?

04:06.567 --> 04:07.448
I'm

04:08.728 --> 04:09.567
sorry.

04:23.848 --> 04:25.608
Who were you whispering to?

04:27.168 --> 04:28.088
Why draw the curtains

04:28.168 --> 04:29.488
in the middle of the day?

04:30.408 --> 04:32.007
Hurry up and get changed.

04:32.288 --> 04:34.408
Professor Jiang wrote you
a recommendation letter.

04:34.848 --> 04:36.367
We need to thank him.

04:36.848 --> 04:38.127
I played games all night

04:38.207 --> 04:39.088
with Chen Xingqi.

04:40.088 --> 04:42.207
Even a full-time nanny gets a break.

04:43.567 --> 04:44.488
Why don't you send me

04:45.168 --> 04:46.367
to the national team

04:46.528 --> 04:47.928
for Ultra-Extreme Triathlon?

04:48.327 --> 04:48.807
Chen Luzhou.

04:49.447 --> 04:50.888
Could you please be serious?

04:50.968 --> 04:51.968
How am I not serious?

04:52.567 --> 04:53.968
I have a lot more to say.

04:57.608 --> 04:59.648
But have I ever gone against you?

05:00.767 --> 05:02.488
Repeat a year. Go abroad.

05:03.088 --> 05:04.408
I'll do whatever you say.

05:07.007 --> 05:07.848
Zhu Yangqi would

05:07.928 --> 05:09.367
call me "Mama's boy".

05:10.807 --> 05:12.207
I promise I'll let you know

05:12.528 --> 05:14.168
when I have a girlfriend.

05:14.567 --> 05:15.127
Okay?

05:15.447 --> 05:16.488
I'm going to sleep.

05:16.848 --> 05:17.567
Sleep?

05:18.567 --> 05:20.048
Your home isn't here.

05:20.887 --> 05:23.327
College Entrance Examination is over.
Move back home.

05:24.088 --> 05:24.928
Move back home?

05:25.088 --> 05:25.728
Forget it.

05:26.447 --> 05:27.687
I'm going abroad soon.

05:27.807 --> 05:28.807
Why bother

05:29.048 --> 05:30.007
moving back and forth?

05:36.711 --> 05:38.424
(Troublemaker)

05:43.608 --> 05:44.687
What's wrong?

05:47.767 --> 05:48.727
Wait for me.

05:48.807 --> 05:49.687
I'll be right there.

05:50.168 --> 05:51.168
Understand?

05:53.207 --> 05:54.288
Troublemaker.

06:13.887 --> 06:15.048
Chen Xingqi.

06:15.207 --> 06:16.728
You caused your mom trouble again?

06:38.088 --> 06:40.127
(Monkey King,
I lured the tigress away, okay?)

06:40.207 --> 06:41.968
(How are you going to thank me?)

06:43.127 --> 06:45.088
You called your mom a tigress?

06:52.247 --> 06:53.288
(Chen Luzhou.)

06:53.648 --> 06:55.567
(Isn't my mom also your mom?)

06:57.968 --> 07:01.088
(Luzhou, so this is your type, huh?)

07:12.447 --> 07:14.327
(Stylish Zhu, Lucy, is Gu Yan there?)

07:14.887 --> 07:15.928
Zhu Yangqi.

07:16.807 --> 07:18.367
(Billiard room)
It's not my fault.

07:18.728 --> 07:20.648
Gu Yan forced me to tell her
where you live.

07:21.007 --> 07:22.807
She said she forged a love diary

07:22.968 --> 07:24.367
with you to gain fame on a whim

07:24.567 --> 07:25.968
and got caught by netizens.

07:26.288 --> 07:27.528
If it is confirmed,

07:27.648 --> 07:30.007
she can't be an actress
even if she gets into

07:30.168 --> 07:31.488
the Film Academy.

07:32.007 --> 07:33.767
I panicked when I heard it.

07:37.367 --> 07:38.488
So you just gave her

07:38.767 --> 07:40.168
my address right away.

07:43.288 --> 07:43.928
Zhu Yangqi.

07:44.608 --> 07:45.408
Do you realize

07:45.528 --> 07:46.408
this could make me

07:46.528 --> 07:47.207
single forever?

07:47.807 --> 07:48.728
Is it that serious?

07:53.887 --> 07:54.608
Chen Luzhou.

07:55.367 --> 07:56.648
I really like you.

07:59.088 --> 08:01.247
Can you go along with it
and be my boyfriend?

08:01.608 --> 08:02.367
No.

08:03.007 --> 08:03.807
Why not?

08:04.767 --> 08:05.807
Is there someone you like?

08:06.528 --> 08:07.288
I just don't

08:08.127 --> 08:09.207
have feelings for you.

08:10.127 --> 08:10.728
And then?

08:11.528 --> 08:13.007
Then my mom came.

08:13.367 --> 08:14.447
So thrilling.

08:14.648 --> 08:16.048
Your mom caught you on the spot.

08:16.728 --> 08:18.767
Zhu Yangqi.

08:20.127 --> 08:21.687
You disappointed me a lot.

08:22.648 --> 08:24.367
Don't tell anyone my address again.

08:25.687 --> 08:26.207
Got it.

08:27.367 --> 08:28.608
I swear solemnly.

08:28.807 --> 08:30.127
It won't happen again.

08:32.567 --> 08:35.207
But many people
think you're a hopeless romantic

08:35.928 --> 08:39.567
who didn't take the Optional Modules
because of Gu Yan.

08:40.248 --> 08:41.408
Why should I care

08:42.248 --> 08:43.648
about what they say?

08:45.528 --> 08:45.967
I'm off.

08:46.967 --> 08:47.768
Done with it?

08:48.048 --> 08:48.967
It's boring. I'm out.

08:50.288 --> 08:51.048
Wait.

08:52.607 --> 08:53.967
I'll treat you to barbecue later.

08:54.048 --> 08:54.687
Barbecue?

08:55.888 --> 08:56.408
No, thanks.

08:56.967 --> 08:58.528
See you around. It's done.

09:02.888 --> 09:04.447
Grandma, Dad, I'm back.

09:05.207 --> 09:06.168
Zhi.

09:06.687 --> 09:08.448
Where have you been all day?

09:08.528 --> 09:10.328
I estimated the scores in Ruijun.

09:10.727 --> 09:12.727
What? Sun Wukong passed out?

09:13.607 --> 09:17.168
Yeah, Zhu Bajie captured the Tang Monk.

09:18.168 --> 09:19.687
"Estimate the scores."

09:19.847 --> 09:21.687
Even I hear better than you.

09:23.447 --> 09:24.487
How was it?

09:24.967 --> 09:26.487
Everything went as planned.

09:26.928 --> 09:27.567
Yes!

09:27.768 --> 09:29.207
Why can't I claim this?

09:30.528 --> 09:31.727
How much did Yingying score?

09:32.807 --> 09:34.168
You sound quite concerned.

09:35.928 --> 09:37.767
Your Uncle Cai has high blood pressure.

09:37.847 --> 09:39.568
He might be shocked by her score.

09:39.648 --> 09:40.247
Right?

09:40.327 --> 09:42.648
Then you should
show more concern for Mr. Cai.

09:42.648 --> 09:43.567
Really.

09:44.528 --> 09:45.368
It's over.

09:46.248 --> 09:47.487
It's over.

09:48.807 --> 09:50.847
Dad, I like that you have time

09:51.128 --> 09:51.887
to cook at home.

09:51.967 --> 09:52.847
I can come home

09:52.928 --> 09:54.087
from the college for food.

09:55.648 --> 09:57.408
What do you mean?

09:58.607 --> 09:59.808
You haven't applied

09:59.888 --> 10:00.847
to universities yet.

10:01.168 --> 10:02.967
Are you going to Qingyi University?

10:03.607 --> 10:04.768
Isn't that pretty good?

10:04.928 --> 10:05.928
It's close by.

10:06.048 --> 10:07.207
What's good about that?

10:08.288 --> 10:10.367
Mom, didn't we agree
to visit the Great Wall?

10:10.447 --> 10:11.800
Grandma, dinner's ready.

10:12.687 --> 10:13.727
- Come on.
- Forget it.

10:13.807 --> 10:15.567
I'm going back to work after dinner.

10:16.408 --> 10:17.928
Give Grandma a bath tonight.

10:18.087 --> 10:18.847
I'm not doing it.

10:19.368 --> 10:20.967
No matter what you say.

10:21.967 --> 10:23.087
I just won't do it.

10:23.567 --> 10:24.327
Sit down.

10:24.687 --> 10:25.768
If you don't do it,

10:26.207 --> 10:27.888
I won't top up
your in-game "happy beans"

10:28.128 --> 10:29.248
once you run out.

10:32.327 --> 10:34.247
Let's do it after dinner.

10:34.327 --> 10:35.048
Okay.

10:37.368 --> 10:38.687
Grandma, dig in.

10:39.528 --> 10:41.248
Let me have some meat.

10:41.528 --> 10:43.128
It's a bit sweet.

10:43.327 --> 10:45.128
Go easy on the sweet and sour pork.

10:48.447 --> 10:49.727
You can have more.

10:49.888 --> 10:51.048
I made it really well.

11:00.231 --> 11:01.816
(Mom)

11:02.023 --> 11:08.664
(Chat history: Happy birthday, Mom.)

11:13.447 --> 11:15.848
(Yingying)

11:15.928 --> 11:18.327
(Help me dye my hair exactly like this.)

11:22.327 --> 11:23.967
(Nostalgic about the Shamate culture?)

11:27.800 --> 11:30.607
(Ten things to do after graduation)
Hello. Welcome to Yingying's vlog.

11:30.607 --> 11:31.727
Today, let's talk about

11:31.888 --> 11:34.327
the ten things
you must do after graduation.

11:34.487 --> 11:35.248
Take a look.

11:35.408 --> 11:36.847
Dye your hair. Get ear piercings.

11:37.008 --> 11:38.727
Go on a spontaneous trip.

11:39.008 --> 11:40.048
Did you film it?

11:41.487 --> 11:42.207
Okay.

11:42.447 --> 11:44.807
Today, I'm going to dye my hair.

11:46.087 --> 11:48.008
Still lying? Xu Zhi.

11:48.528 --> 11:50.687
Can you stop making me worried?

11:50.928 --> 11:52.368
Time's up.

11:52.487 --> 11:54.128
Zhi, hurry up. Film me.

11:58.087 --> 11:58.727
Ready?

11:59.487 --> 12:00.487
Alright, guys.

12:00.607 --> 12:02.447
Now let's see my new hair color.

12:03.687 --> 12:04.687
I'm so nervous.

12:07.008 --> 12:07.888
How do I look?

12:11.008 --> 12:12.008
I hereby declare

12:12.168 --> 12:14.727
that dyeing my hair
is checked off my list.

12:14.967 --> 12:16.048
Challenge accomplished!

12:16.248 --> 12:18.128
Give it a go if you're interested.

12:19.607 --> 12:20.248
How is it?

12:22.768 --> 12:23.727
Let me see.

12:29.288 --> 12:30.248
It's quite nice.

12:33.888 --> 12:35.528
What's wrong? Are you upset?

12:36.768 --> 12:38.288
No, I was thinking about something.

12:38.928 --> 12:40.087
- A quick question.
- What?

12:40.727 --> 12:42.727
Do you think two people can sound

12:42.807 --> 12:43.928
exactly the same?

12:45.248 --> 12:46.168
What do you mean?

12:46.648 --> 12:47.768
I met an auntie yesterday.

12:48.648 --> 12:50.567
Her voice, tone, and catchphrases were

12:50.687 --> 12:51.687
exactly like my mom's.

12:53.528 --> 12:54.487
Where did you meet her?

12:54.687 --> 12:56.327
Under the apartment Tan Xu rented.

12:57.128 --> 12:58.528
You went to see Tan Xu?

12:59.607 --> 13:00.487
I went to talk to him

13:00.607 --> 13:01.727
and get my necklace back.

13:02.727 --> 13:04.288
You gave him the necklace?

13:04.408 --> 13:05.368
No, I lent it to him.

13:06.408 --> 13:07.928
He said that the four-leaf clover

13:08.368 --> 13:10.008
represents luck and borrowed it

13:10.207 --> 13:12.288
for good luck during
College Entrance Examination.

13:12.288 --> 13:14.168
That's just wishful thinking.

13:14.528 --> 13:15.528
In the end, he failed.

13:17.048 --> 13:18.168
Did he return it to you?

13:19.687 --> 13:21.847
He wasn't there
and didn't answer the phone.

13:22.607 --> 13:24.288
Why is he so full of himself?

13:24.447 --> 13:25.288
He didn't do well,

13:25.368 --> 13:26.648
so he's just being petty?

13:26.967 --> 13:29.087
He got mad
because you did great last time.

13:29.248 --> 13:30.487
He's totally gaslighting you.

13:31.967 --> 13:33.168
But he's repeating the year.

13:33.807 --> 13:35.847
I want to talk to him in a bit.

13:36.487 --> 13:37.768
You're going there again?

13:37.928 --> 13:39.648
Don't worry, I know what I'm doing.

13:39.768 --> 13:41.567
I'll get the necklace and leave.

13:43.487 --> 13:44.128
I'll come along.

13:44.327 --> 13:44.768
Alright.

13:52.487 --> 13:53.288
Second floor?

14:00.807 --> 14:01.408
Here.

14:13.048 --> 14:13.928
Here to mock me?

14:14.888 --> 14:16.447
Do you have to be so mean?

14:19.168 --> 14:19.727
Go ahead.

14:20.408 --> 14:21.327
What's there to say?

14:22.168 --> 14:22.888
Come in.

14:23.368 --> 14:24.607
Can you stop being

14:24.687 --> 14:26.607
so negative before the results are out?

14:26.967 --> 14:29.048
It's because I solved
the last two math questions

14:29.128 --> 14:30.567
and you didn't?

14:30.807 --> 14:32.288
If that makes you so upset,

14:32.648 --> 14:33.808
I admit it's my fault.

14:33.888 --> 14:35.288
She's bad at comforting people,

14:35.408 --> 14:36.648
just like you.

14:37.447 --> 14:39.768
Many people from the No. 1 High School
didn't do well.

14:40.447 --> 14:42.768
The prospective top scorer
even missed out on one subject.

14:44.487 --> 14:45.928
The prospective top scorer.

14:46.087 --> 14:47.447
She's talking about you.

14:48.447 --> 14:49.288
But she doesn't know

14:49.368 --> 14:51.248
that you missed out
on the Optional Modules.

14:51.807 --> 14:54.087
She's comforting her useless boyfriend
with your story.

14:54.847 --> 14:56.168
Why don't you tell them?

14:56.847 --> 14:58.207
Why should I?

14:58.327 --> 15:00.207
I may have missed out on one subject,

15:00.368 --> 15:01.408
but I won't

15:02.847 --> 15:04.008
fall into despair.

15:04.128 --> 15:06.136
Nor do I need comfort of a girlfriend.

15:06.136 --> 15:07.687
Her boyfriend is too lame.

15:09.408 --> 15:10.128
Let's go.

15:12.207 --> 15:12.928
So what?

15:13.327 --> 15:14.248
Get to the point.

15:14.768 --> 15:16.408
There is no real despair,

15:16.888 --> 15:18.447
only prisoners of their thoughts.

15:18.607 --> 15:19.807
This is what you told me.

15:21.847 --> 15:24.048
I really appreciate you tutoring me

15:24.248 --> 15:25.368
and helping me through.

15:25.888 --> 15:27.128
If you need me,

15:27.288 --> 15:28.487
I'd love to help you.

15:28.687 --> 15:29.327
No, thanks.

15:29.607 --> 15:30.607
I don't need your pity.

15:30.768 --> 15:31.487
Tan Xu.

15:32.048 --> 15:32.367
I...

15:32.447 --> 15:33.567
Stop being a hypocrite.

15:35.168 --> 15:36.647
Didn't you come

15:36.727 --> 15:38.408
to sever your tie with me?

15:39.727 --> 15:40.768
You're going to college.

15:41.567 --> 15:42.776
I'm repeating the year.

15:43.248 --> 15:45.008
We'll head into two different worlds.

15:46.008 --> 15:47.288
Thanks for the reminder.

15:47.648 --> 15:48.567
I know it very well.

15:49.967 --> 15:51.088
That's what you think?

15:51.168 --> 15:52.168
Of course.

15:52.768 --> 15:53.967
Anyway, the exams are over.

15:54.408 --> 15:55.528
I have

15:55.847 --> 15:57.127
no more value to you.

15:57.207 --> 15:58.288
Do you have to be

15:58.368 --> 16:00.087
so sarcastic and cynical?

16:01.248 --> 16:02.367
In that case,

16:02.447 --> 16:03.888
I want my necklace back.

16:05.368 --> 16:06.448
Let's not meet

16:06.528 --> 16:07.408
unless it's necessary.

16:22.087 --> 16:23.207
Are you crazy?

16:25.648 --> 16:26.528
Let's go.

16:33.327 --> 16:34.767
- Are you okay?
- I'm fine.

16:34.847 --> 16:36.048
It's not here.

16:41.368 --> 16:42.168
Zhi.

16:43.487 --> 16:45.648
Could it be in this tree?

16:46.967 --> 16:48.447
It's very likely.

16:49.207 --> 16:50.567
How are we going to find it?

16:57.687 --> 16:58.968
Don't you think

16:59.048 --> 17:01.647
that girl's sarcastic way of speaking

17:01.727 --> 17:03.087
is quite similar to yours?

17:03.168 --> 17:03.727
So what?

17:04.487 --> 17:05.368
So,

17:05.568 --> 17:07.368
will you try to date her?

17:09.408 --> 17:10.328
Why should I?

17:10.727 --> 17:13.287
You'll have nothing to do
for two months before you go abroad.

17:13.527 --> 17:14.408
Still, not interested.

17:14.928 --> 17:16.447
Did you get PTSD

17:16.568 --> 17:17.808
because of Gu Yan?

17:18.368 --> 17:19.047
Not really.

17:19.848 --> 17:20.928
My mom is strict with me.

17:21.727 --> 17:22.287
I promised

17:22.368 --> 17:24.527
to tell her before getting a girlfriend.

17:24.727 --> 17:25.728
Besides, we'll have to

17:25.808 --> 17:27.008
video chat every day

17:27.088 --> 17:28.487
once I go abroad.

17:30.408 --> 17:31.287
But then...

17:32.247 --> 17:33.888
Long-distance relationships could work.

17:35.047 --> 17:36.288
But I'm broke.

17:36.368 --> 17:38.088
If my mom unlocks my card,

17:38.328 --> 17:39.767
then I might consider it.

17:40.608 --> 17:41.967
Otherwise, I can't even fly back

17:42.047 --> 17:43.647
when my girlfriend misses me.

17:43.727 --> 17:44.767
Isn't that awkward?

17:45.928 --> 17:48.168
I just mentioned it for fun.

17:48.527 --> 17:50.088
But you took it quite far.

17:50.168 --> 17:51.687
And you sound well-planned.

17:52.247 --> 17:54.368
Are you really thinking about it?

17:54.767 --> 17:56.167
She used me as a negative example.

17:56.247 --> 17:57.648
Can't I just think about it?

18:02.687 --> 18:03.408
Who is it?

18:07.487 --> 18:08.408
Coming.

18:12.527 --> 18:13.287
Can you...

18:14.727 --> 18:15.247
Lucy.

18:15.767 --> 18:16.727
Lucy, hurry up!

18:18.247 --> 18:18.888
What?

18:19.447 --> 18:20.888
The pretty girl is here.

18:26.888 --> 18:27.527
What's wrong?

18:27.727 --> 18:29.128
Can you do me a favor?

18:29.527 --> 18:30.768
My necklace might be

18:30.848 --> 18:32.648
hanging in that tree over there.

18:32.808 --> 18:33.648
I can't help you.

18:34.408 --> 18:35.487
Hurry, go.

18:38.088 --> 18:39.128
Go ahead. I'll come later.

18:44.287 --> 18:45.168
Don't be embarrassed.

18:45.168 --> 18:47.168
You blocked me out like this yesterday.

19:09.168 --> 19:11.687
You got yourself a handsome helper.

19:17.007 --> 19:17.568
How about

19:18.648 --> 19:19.527
I buy you a new one?

19:20.047 --> 19:21.487
That's inappropriate.

19:23.207 --> 19:25.168
I'd like to see how you got it up there.

19:27.967 --> 19:30.608
Sorry for the trouble.
That necklace is quite valuable.

19:31.287 --> 19:31.808
Really?

19:32.767 --> 19:34.048
Then you'd better make a wish.

19:34.128 --> 19:35.207
Or it'll be wasted.

19:36.047 --> 19:38.088
I think I saw a drone
at your place yesterday.

19:38.328 --> 19:39.568
Can you fly it up there?

19:41.328 --> 19:42.607
I also have a plane.

19:42.687 --> 19:43.687
Are you interested?

19:47.088 --> 19:48.447
I got this.

19:51.088 --> 19:52.487
Is she impersonating a parrot?

19:53.047 --> 19:54.407
He says I'm a parrot.

19:54.487 --> 19:55.447
What are you doing?

19:55.727 --> 19:56.568
What do you think?

19:56.687 --> 19:58.936
- Looking for her necklace.
- He says I'm like a parrot.

19:58.936 --> 20:00.047
Why did you get my tripod?

20:00.287 --> 20:01.407
It's an emergency.

20:01.487 --> 20:02.928
Come on, make way.

20:03.168 --> 20:04.207
Don't get hurt.

20:19.967 --> 20:21.247
A big gold chain.

20:22.128 --> 20:22.928
Valuable indeed.

20:23.527 --> 20:24.247
This isn't mine.

20:28.608 --> 20:29.888
Let me do it.

20:33.447 --> 20:34.088
Where is it?

20:34.168 --> 20:35.808
Just hold it like this.

20:36.247 --> 20:36.967
Where is it?

20:37.287 --> 20:37.687
Do this.

20:37.767 --> 20:38.447
Where is it?

20:43.047 --> 20:44.007
Yingying, over there.

20:44.168 --> 20:44.767
Where?

20:44.848 --> 20:45.328
There.

20:45.408 --> 20:45.927
Where?

20:46.007 --> 20:46.727
There, I see it.

20:47.128 --> 20:48.007
- Come on.
- Come on.

20:48.207 --> 20:49.288
Help me.

20:49.368 --> 20:51.168
Lower it a bit, yeah.

21:12.047 --> 21:12.767
That's it.

21:12.967 --> 21:13.568
Is it broken?

21:15.328 --> 21:15.928
No.

21:16.928 --> 21:17.447
Thank you.

21:18.088 --> 21:19.287
Can I buy you dinner?

21:19.527 --> 21:20.687
- Sure.
- No need.

21:25.328 --> 21:26.447
So unfriendly.

21:26.767 --> 21:29.088
Are you afraid we're trying
to make a move on you two?

21:29.368 --> 21:30.287
Both of us

21:31.047 --> 21:32.608
have boyfriends.

21:35.808 --> 21:38.048
Handsome guys like him
hate being pestered.

21:38.128 --> 21:39.568
We have to do the opposite.

21:40.328 --> 21:42.527
We'll pass since you have boyfriends.

21:42.727 --> 21:43.287
Bye.

21:44.328 --> 21:45.487
Come on.

21:49.368 --> 21:50.168
Well...

21:52.848 --> 21:54.727
My mom left me this necklace.

21:55.088 --> 21:56.527
It's very important to me.

21:56.848 --> 21:59.368
You helped me get it.

21:59.967 --> 22:01.247
I want to buy you food

22:01.408 --> 22:02.487
to not owe you a favor.

22:05.408 --> 22:06.687
Lead the way, then.

22:08.247 --> 22:08.928
Okay.

22:09.888 --> 22:10.648
What are we having?

22:11.727 --> 22:12.967
Barbecue.

22:13.447 --> 22:15.687
Are you really
stealing someone's girlfriend?

22:24.888 --> 22:26.727
It was his mom
who sounded like your mom?

22:27.088 --> 22:28.487
Yeah, that's right.

22:29.527 --> 22:31.247
So, you plan to

22:31.447 --> 22:32.608
get close to him first

22:32.967 --> 22:34.088
and approach his mom?

22:35.088 --> 22:36.408
That's exciting.

22:39.247 --> 22:40.608
There is a new place over there.

22:41.447 --> 22:42.328
Really?

22:43.168 --> 22:45.007
Are you watching "The Bicycle Thief"?

22:45.568 --> 22:46.767
I also like this director.

22:49.727 --> 22:51.608
One of his movies is being re-released.

22:51.727 --> 22:53.088
Want to watch it? It's on me.

22:53.608 --> 22:54.568
(Flirting with me?)

22:54.568 --> 22:55.808
One meal is enough.

22:56.128 --> 22:57.648
(I can't just tell you)

22:58.168 --> 22:59.608
(I want to meet your mom.)

22:59.767 --> 23:01.656
It's okay if you're not interested.

23:04.168 --> 23:04.928
Does your boyfriend

23:05.207 --> 23:06.247
know we're having dinner?

23:06.568 --> 23:08.527
Am I not allowed
to have dinner with a guy?

23:10.287 --> 23:11.047
Good question.

23:17.799 --> 23:22.584
(Hu's Barbecue)

23:24.047 --> 23:24.648
Tasty, right?

23:25.487 --> 23:26.328
It's so good.

23:26.848 --> 23:27.247
Thanks.

23:27.408 --> 23:28.168
Dig in.

23:30.368 --> 23:30.767
Thanks.

23:34.568 --> 23:36.328
What's your birthday?

23:40.447 --> 23:41.928
Don't you know about pickup lines?

23:42.328 --> 23:43.527
Ask for the name first.

23:46.328 --> 23:47.168
Xu Zhi.

23:50.247 --> 23:50.888
Chen Luzhou.

23:52.608 --> 23:54.088
You know a lot about pickup lines?

23:59.848 --> 24:01.447
No, don't get our Lucy wrong.

24:01.967 --> 24:03.808
He's always the one being approached.

24:04.608 --> 24:07.447
Why is a guy like him called Lucy?

24:08.687 --> 24:11.207
That's because he is too good-looking.

24:11.287 --> 24:12.647
His English tutor mistook him

24:12.727 --> 24:14.168
for a girl when he was young.

24:14.287 --> 24:14.928
That's enough.

24:16.207 --> 24:17.647
You don't look like a girl now.

24:17.727 --> 24:19.168
You look very handsome.

24:19.287 --> 24:19.888
Right, Zhi?

24:20.287 --> 24:21.007
Yeah.

24:23.928 --> 24:25.888
I'm still curious about
how your necklace

24:26.568 --> 24:27.648
ended up in the tree.

24:29.808 --> 24:30.487
Well...

24:30.727 --> 24:35.047
She did better than her boyfriend
in College Entrance Examination.

24:35.447 --> 24:37.848
He resorted to cold violence

24:38.007 --> 24:39.088
because he felt inferior.

24:39.447 --> 24:40.767
This wasn't the first time.

24:40.967 --> 24:42.088
Zhi went to ask him

24:42.247 --> 24:43.168
for her necklace back.

24:43.447 --> 24:44.328
But he lost it

24:44.447 --> 24:45.207
and threw it

24:45.328 --> 24:46.128
downstairs.

24:50.287 --> 24:52.088
People say that one shouldn't look for

24:52.247 --> 24:53.808
a boyfriend in the trash can.

24:54.328 --> 24:55.007
But look at you.

24:55.568 --> 24:57.568
You went directly
to the recycling station.

24:58.128 --> 24:59.967
Trying to keep the trash to yourself?

25:00.527 --> 25:01.248
You're failing

25:01.328 --> 25:02.767
to meet the KPI because of that?

25:04.088 --> 25:05.168
It's just my advice.

25:05.368 --> 25:06.608
Handsome guys are everywhere.

25:07.368 --> 25:09.128
We have many in the No.1 High School.

25:09.568 --> 25:11.648
Don't miss the forest for one dead tree.

25:12.368 --> 25:13.727
You are from the No.1 High School?

25:14.047 --> 25:14.808
Yeah.

25:14.888 --> 25:15.928
Can't you tell?

25:17.328 --> 25:18.808
Do you know Zhai Xiao?

25:19.047 --> 25:20.408
Yeah, we play basketball.

25:23.207 --> 25:24.767
What a coincidence.

25:25.447 --> 25:26.408
You know him, too?

25:29.928 --> 25:32.008
Then I have a lot to tell you.

25:32.088 --> 25:32.928
Go ahead.

25:33.928 --> 25:34.808
He'll be here soon.

25:35.007 --> 25:36.047
Let's eat first.

25:39.247 --> 25:40.808
(Skewer)
Let me do it.

25:42.648 --> 25:44.207
Weren't you supposed to treat us?

25:44.568 --> 25:46.088
Did you expect me to pay?

25:47.168 --> 25:48.808
Of course, I'm paying.

25:49.928 --> 25:51.328
Table eight, please.

25:54.767 --> 25:55.608
Thanks.

26:00.568 --> 26:01.407
Sorry.

26:01.487 --> 26:02.607
It's getting stuck.

26:02.687 --> 26:03.967
Just a second.

26:11.368 --> 26:12.288
Happy now?

26:12.368 --> 26:13.167
Queue up.

26:13.247 --> 26:14.047
No.

26:15.808 --> 26:17.408
Fine, let's have another round.

26:17.568 --> 26:19.287
Take my seat if you win, okay?

26:19.527 --> 26:20.568
No.

26:21.207 --> 26:23.568
I just lost five rounds to you.

26:23.848 --> 26:24.687
You cheated.

26:26.047 --> 26:27.527
You can't just call me a cheater

26:27.687 --> 26:28.527
because you lost.

26:28.767 --> 26:30.648
Then how did you win me every time?

26:31.576 --> 26:32.856
Maybe you're dumb.

26:33.088 --> 26:34.687
Aren't you afraid of Ultraman?

26:37.447 --> 26:39.167
Yes, I am terrified.

26:39.247 --> 26:40.568
Do you believe

26:40.648 --> 26:42.808
that I'll ask Ultraman
to teach you a lesson?

26:43.088 --> 26:44.088
Mebius.

26:44.168 --> 26:45.888
The mascot of the Ultraman world.

26:46.168 --> 26:47.047
Mascot.

26:47.888 --> 26:50.088
Aren't mascots usually the weakest ones?

26:53.128 --> 26:53.967
Big brother.

26:54.047 --> 26:55.288
How old are you?

26:55.368 --> 26:57.247
Why did you take the seat from a kid?

26:57.487 --> 26:58.887
It's tiring to stay standing.

26:58.967 --> 26:59.728
If you don't mind,

26:59.808 --> 27:01.168
I can call you brother.

27:04.328 --> 27:05.687
Enough, brother.

27:05.767 --> 27:07.767
Your snot is sticking to my clothes.

27:09.328 --> 27:10.928
Son.

27:11.128 --> 27:11.888
What's going on?

27:12.328 --> 27:13.527
Son, what's wrong?

27:13.848 --> 27:16.247
Dad, he took my seat.

27:16.727 --> 27:17.967
What's going on here?

27:18.368 --> 27:20.487
Don't you feel ashamed to take

27:20.608 --> 27:21.447
a child's seat?

27:21.727 --> 27:22.648
I was here first.

27:22.848 --> 27:23.247
You...

27:23.447 --> 27:24.247
He's lying.

27:24.447 --> 27:26.287
I was here first.

27:26.447 --> 27:27.408
He also hit me.

27:27.648 --> 27:28.047
He did?

27:28.168 --> 27:29.047
It hurts so much.

27:29.408 --> 27:30.887
Where did he hit you?

27:30.967 --> 27:31.248
He...

27:31.328 --> 27:32.767
Tell me. Where did he hit you?

27:32.888 --> 27:34.207
H-He kicked me.

27:34.527 --> 27:35.047
He did?

27:35.648 --> 27:36.487
He kicked you?

27:37.128 --> 27:38.247
Alright, young man.

27:38.408 --> 27:39.487
You hit my son, huh?

27:39.687 --> 27:40.967
Let's get things straight.

27:41.168 --> 27:41.967
What do you want?

27:42.687 --> 27:43.368
Young man.

27:44.328 --> 27:45.007
Kid.

27:45.447 --> 27:47.088
Where did he hit you?

27:47.207 --> 27:48.928
Does it hurt? Let me see.

27:49.767 --> 27:52.447
H-He kicked me.

27:53.967 --> 27:55.888
His shoe soles are so clean.

27:56.047 --> 27:58.007
They didn't leave a mark
on your white pants.

27:58.608 --> 27:59.527
What do you mean?

27:59.687 --> 28:01.247
My son must have cleaned it.

28:01.447 --> 28:02.928
Are you saying that my son lied?

28:03.207 --> 28:04.488
Uncle, don't get worked up.

28:04.568 --> 28:06.008
It's reasonable doubt.

28:06.088 --> 28:07.528
I'm not worked up.

28:07.608 --> 28:08.328
I'm not angry.

28:08.408 --> 28:09.888
We're reasonable people, okay?

28:10.247 --> 28:11.447
Who are you calling "Uncle"?

28:11.767 --> 28:13.007
Do I look that old?

28:13.527 --> 28:14.648
He hit my kid.

28:14.767 --> 28:16.247
Thank you, young man.

28:17.408 --> 28:18.047
You're back.

28:18.808 --> 28:20.488
Dad, sit. Be careful.

28:20.568 --> 28:22.368
This place turns out to be so popular.

28:22.687 --> 28:23.687
Be careful.

28:24.047 --> 28:24.687
Be careful.

28:24.967 --> 28:26.207
My dad doesn't walk well.

28:26.287 --> 28:27.288
We went to the restroom

28:27.368 --> 28:29.287
because this young man saved us a seat.

28:29.608 --> 28:30.648
Your waiting ticket.

28:38.007 --> 28:39.128
What's going on?

28:39.848 --> 28:41.088
He hit you, and does it hurt?

28:43.487 --> 28:45.247
Well, sorry about that.

28:45.928 --> 28:47.287
I didn't teach him well.

28:47.408 --> 28:48.967
I almost got fooled.

28:49.928 --> 28:50.568
Sorry.

28:51.568 --> 28:52.487
Let's go home.

28:53.568 --> 28:54.928
Dad, I want skewers.

28:55.047 --> 28:55.967
Forget it.

28:56.408 --> 28:57.727
How did you learn to lie?

28:57.848 --> 28:58.407
Let's go.

28:58.487 --> 28:59.287
Let's go home.

28:59.568 --> 29:01.207
Bro, we also want skewers.

29:01.287 --> 29:02.568
Are you fools?

29:02.648 --> 29:03.568
Yeah, right.

29:04.328 --> 29:06.047
- Can't you read the room?
- Thanks.

29:07.207 --> 29:08.447
It's CLZ, right?

29:09.047 --> 29:10.447
Let me send you the recording.

29:13.447 --> 29:16.664
(Wireless transfer of audio file)

29:18.007 --> 29:18.928
What's wrong?

29:19.287 --> 29:20.528
My dad works in a hospital.

29:20.608 --> 29:22.328
He's seen lots of people
who pick fights.

29:22.487 --> 29:24.568
He told me to always keep evidence

29:24.928 --> 29:26.687
when I run into someone

29:26.808 --> 29:27.848
who wants trouble.

29:29.247 --> 29:30.608
So friendly on our second meeting?

29:31.527 --> 29:33.088
I thought exchanging names

29:33.287 --> 29:34.207
made us friends.

29:34.808 --> 29:36.835
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

29:37.080 --> 29:39.448
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

29:39.896 --> 29:41.887
♪Falling into your eyes♪

29:41.967 --> 29:43.088
You trust me so much?

29:43.287 --> 29:44.368
Of course.

29:44.608 --> 29:45.967
Why should I believe that kid?

29:46.128 --> 29:47.287
Besides, they were a group.

29:47.487 --> 29:48.368
You were all alone.

29:48.487 --> 29:49.888
I can't let you suffer losses.

29:50.487 --> 29:51.047
Right?

29:53.607 --> 29:59.864
♪Ah♪

30:00.128 --> 30:00.808
What's wrong?

30:01.848 --> 30:04.088
Nothing. My grandma wants
roasted sweet potatoes.

30:04.247 --> 30:05.768
Go back. I'll look around.

30:49.368 --> 30:50.767
Didn't we just meet yesterday?

30:50.928 --> 30:51.767
You missed me again?

30:52.888 --> 30:54.007
Be serious.

30:54.648 --> 30:56.447
The papers for going abroad
are almost ready.

30:56.648 --> 30:58.727
Professor Jiang wants to see you
tomorrow afternoon.

31:00.527 --> 31:01.207
Got it.

31:02.128 --> 31:04.207
Aren't you going to ask
which university it is?

31:04.767 --> 31:06.767
I don't mind. You can decide.

31:07.447 --> 31:08.928
You don't mind anything.

31:09.447 --> 31:10.487
What do you really want?

31:13.207 --> 31:13.767
Talk later.

31:16.792 --> 31:18.888
College Entrance Examination is
coming soon.

31:19.808 --> 31:20.728
When are you

31:20.808 --> 31:22.608
sending Luzhou abroad?

31:23.848 --> 31:25.287
I'm already working on it.

31:25.848 --> 31:26.967
No rush.

31:27.928 --> 31:29.967
Why is it taking so long?

31:32.168 --> 31:33.768
You didn't want

31:33.848 --> 31:35.527
to send him abroad, did you?

31:37.928 --> 31:39.888
He's been here for over ten years.

31:40.128 --> 31:41.848
I've never seen you

31:41.928 --> 31:44.287
lift a finger against him.

31:44.687 --> 31:46.527
But you've never hesitated

31:47.047 --> 31:48.767
to beat your own son.

31:49.727 --> 31:50.328
Mom.

31:51.088 --> 31:53.447
Xingqi is my biological son, after all.

31:54.047 --> 31:55.728
Luzhou is an outsider.

31:55.808 --> 31:57.128
How can they be the same?

31:58.648 --> 32:00.007
You remember he's an outsider?

32:01.128 --> 32:02.408
That's why I'm reminding you.

32:03.088 --> 32:05.687
Luzhou has always been a cunning child.

32:05.928 --> 32:07.928
I'm worried that he won't leave.

32:09.368 --> 32:11.408
Mom, don't worry.

32:12.487 --> 32:13.487
We have been

32:13.648 --> 32:15.168
providing for him since he was six.

32:15.767 --> 32:18.928
Even a puppy would be grateful, right?

32:23.727 --> 32:25.088
(I don't care where to go.)

32:25.088 --> 32:26.408
(It's just me alone, anyway.)

32:29.767 --> 32:35.815
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

32:36.743 --> 32:39.452
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

32:40.297 --> 32:44.839
♪A brilliant scenery♪

32:45.447 --> 32:47.007
Where are Yingying and Zhu Yangqi?

32:47.767 --> 32:48.608
I bet they went

32:48.808 --> 32:49.808
for round two.

32:51.487 --> 32:52.088
Then...

32:53.247 --> 32:53.967
Didn't find any?

32:54.808 --> 32:55.648
They're sold out.

32:56.047 --> 32:57.128
Your grandma is still awake

32:57.247 --> 32:57.967
at this hour?

32:58.047 --> 32:59.607
She'll throw a tantrum if she doesn't

32:59.687 --> 33:01.328
have the sweet potatoes.

33:01.408 --> 33:02.247
Really?

33:03.967 --> 33:05.168
A couple of days ago,

33:05.767 --> 33:07.168
a cleaning lady came

33:07.527 --> 33:09.128
and gave me sweet potatoes

33:09.608 --> 33:11.247
because I tutored her son.

33:13.967 --> 33:15.088
We can...

33:15.767 --> 33:16.687
Go to your place?

33:18.007 --> 33:18.727
Let's go.

33:20.487 --> 33:21.328
Where is it?

33:57.088 --> 33:58.447
Thank you. Let me do this.

34:04.648 --> 34:05.967
Is this umbrella too small?

34:06.047 --> 34:07.687
Let's hide over there.

34:22.208 --> 34:23.007
Thank you.

34:31.808 --> 34:32.888
You don't like rainy days?

34:33.888 --> 34:35.328
I hate rainy days.

34:35.527 --> 34:36.768
I wouldn't have come out

34:37.087 --> 34:38.007
If I had known.

34:38.248 --> 34:38.848
What about you?

34:40.047 --> 34:41.047
I like rainy days.

34:41.368 --> 34:42.888
I don't go out unless it rains.

34:45.607 --> 34:46.487
Do you also like

34:46.567 --> 34:47.808
walking in the rain

34:48.167 --> 34:50.087
and looking up at the sky,
so it's hard to tell

34:50.368 --> 34:52.328
if it's rain or tears on your cheeks

34:52.647 --> 34:54.607
and whether you are sad deep down?

34:55.888 --> 34:56.768
What an expert.

34:57.288 --> 34:58.967
What's so great about rainy days?

34:59.607 --> 35:01.288
Where do I even begin?

35:03.167 --> 35:04.208
When I was a child,

35:04.527 --> 35:05.808
my parents would

35:06.527 --> 35:08.368
take my brother out
and leave me home alone.

35:09.408 --> 35:11.648
But it rained as soon as they went out.

35:11.728 --> 35:13.487
They came back like drowned rats.

35:14.288 --> 35:15.208
I was like, "See?"

35:15.408 --> 35:16.808
"This is what you get."

35:19.248 --> 35:20.888
Isn't it quite interesting?

35:22.768 --> 35:24.248
You're good at cheering yourself up.

35:24.928 --> 35:26.168
Life is already bitter.

35:26.248 --> 35:28.408
Might as well find the funny parts.

35:31.447 --> 35:32.087
What about you?

35:32.928 --> 35:34.527
Why don't you like rainy days?

35:56.568 --> 35:59.127
(Sign-Up for the Teen Motorcycle Race)
I won't sign. Forget it.

35:59.127 --> 36:00.007
Why?

36:00.208 --> 36:01.527
I've been training

36:01.607 --> 36:03.248
for this competition.

36:03.808 --> 36:05.288
Take a look at yourself.

36:05.368 --> 36:06.768
You're injured badly.

36:06.848 --> 36:08.047
What if it's on your face?

36:08.127 --> 36:09.647
What if you hit your head?

36:09.928 --> 36:11.487
I have a helmet.

36:11.567 --> 36:12.967
Besides, all professional players

36:13.047 --> 36:14.328
have been injured.

36:14.527 --> 36:15.527
Sign it.

36:15.607 --> 36:16.367
No way.

36:16.447 --> 36:17.208
Forget it.

36:17.288 --> 36:18.248
I'll ask my dad.

36:18.768 --> 36:20.848
Xu Guangji really spoiled you.

36:20.928 --> 36:23.647
You nearly flooded the house
when playing with water as a child.

36:23.768 --> 36:26.607
Now, you ride a motorbike
and injure yourself.

36:26.728 --> 36:28.647
You've never spared me any worries.

36:52.167 --> 36:53.208
(If you get hurt again,)

36:53.288 --> 36:54.551
(don't come home.)

36:54.631 --> 36:59.608
(Lin Qiudie.)

37:17.567 --> 37:18.328
Hello, Dad.

37:18.567 --> 37:19.967
Why isn't Mom answering the phone?

37:35.487 --> 37:36.647
I just don't like it.

37:37.127 --> 37:38.728
There's no particular reason.

37:49.288 --> 37:49.768
Let's go.

37:49.848 --> 37:50.607
Okay.

37:56.328 --> 37:56.888
By the way,

37:57.368 --> 37:58.447
I forgot to ask you.

37:58.888 --> 38:00.208
Is your mom at home?

38:00.447 --> 38:01.087
Do you want her

38:01.167 --> 38:02.368
to be there or not?

38:06.208 --> 38:07.808
If you want to see me get scolded,

38:07.888 --> 38:09.248
you'll be disappointed.

38:09.527 --> 38:10.808
She doesn't live with me.

38:12.688 --> 38:14.087
I'm indeed a bit disappointed.

38:14.527 --> 38:15.288
But

38:15.408 --> 38:16.728
next time your mom comes,

38:16.928 --> 38:18.127
remember to save me a seat.

38:19.127 --> 38:20.408
You need to buy a ticket.

38:21.248 --> 38:22.487
How much is it?

38:25.368 --> 38:26.328
Sit anywhere you like.

38:40.248 --> 38:41.808
CLZ.

38:43.208 --> 38:44.768
That's so narcissistic.

38:50.328 --> 38:51.728
I'll give you six of them.

38:52.688 --> 38:53.567
Can you roast it?

38:54.688 --> 38:56.368
Do you have a microwave?

38:57.647 --> 38:58.647
You'll do it here?

38:58.848 --> 39:00.928
Can I? We don't have a microwave.

39:02.248 --> 39:03.127
(Really?)

39:04.127 --> 39:04.928
Really.

39:05.167 --> 39:07.007
Grandma thinks it has radiation

39:07.127 --> 39:08.127
and won't allow its use.

39:08.967 --> 39:10.808
Six is a bit much. Two will do.

39:13.208 --> 39:14.328
(Keep making things up.)

39:16.208 --> 39:16.688
Sure.

39:17.087 --> 39:17.688
Alright.

39:33.248 --> 39:34.768
Do you cook?

39:36.368 --> 39:38.127
I make instant noodles sometimes.

39:42.768 --> 39:44.808
Does your mom come to cook for you?

39:46.047 --> 39:46.928
Coming for free meals?

39:47.127 --> 39:47.848
Can I?

39:48.728 --> 39:51.567
(I am in trouble.)

39:52.167 --> 39:53.647
Let me friend you on WeChat.

39:53.967 --> 39:55.384
My phone is out of battery.

40:33.007 --> 40:35.007
Finally free from night study!

40:35.127 --> 40:36.487
We've graduated.

40:36.848 --> 40:38.768
Let the holiday begin.

40:38.936 --> 40:42.465
♪We are not afraid of
the complicated world♪

40:42.687 --> 40:46.220
♪Only passionate love
like a ray of sunshine♪

40:46.426 --> 40:48.536
♪Can beat the night♪

40:48.728 --> 40:51.819
♪We can outrun time♪

40:52.856 --> 40:56.536
♪Let beautiful stories and wishes♪

40:56.728 --> 40:59.487
♪All blend into our season♪

40:59.567 --> 41:02.087
Zhi, let me tell you something shocking.

41:02.288 --> 41:03.408
I have a hunch.

41:03.567 --> 41:05.967
You'll find your Mr. Right
in the upcoming month.

41:06.728 --> 41:08.848
He should be someone hard to handle

41:08.928 --> 41:10.408
but incredibly awesome.

41:11.047 --> 41:11.688
How about that?

41:11.768 --> 41:14.128
Doesn't your boyfriend sound arrogant

41:14.208 --> 41:15.407
but worth looking forward to?

41:15.487 --> 41:16.487
Sounds boring.

41:16.567 --> 41:18.167
Tell him not to show up. Thanks.

41:19.143 --> 41:22.344
(Sometimes a simple choice)

41:22.424 --> 41:25.528
(determines who you'll run into)

41:25.624 --> 41:32.056
(and what kind of person you'll become.)

41:33.064 --> 41:38.880
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

41:39.432 --> 41:44.960
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

41:46.472 --> 41:50.920
♪The world is too quiet♪

41:51.912 --> 41:58.840
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

41:59.752 --> 42:04.840
♪Who will visit me♪

42:05.896 --> 42:11.520
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

42:12.264 --> 42:15.320
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

42:15.560 --> 42:20.880
♪Into concern and care♪

42:26.408 --> 42:31.520
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

42:32.040 --> 42:37.880
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

42:39.336 --> 42:42.720
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

42:42.856 --> 42:49.080
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

42:49.576 --> 42:52.520
♪The lonely clock♪

42:52.680 --> 42:57.280
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

42:57.672 --> 43:00.920
♪Are we both♪

43:01.192 --> 43:04.720
♪Attracted to each other♪

43:05.864 --> 43:12.480
♪Falling into you♪

43:16.200 --> 43:22.000
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

43:22.856 --> 43:25.520
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

43:26.056 --> 43:30.680
♪From reaching eternity♪

43:31.080 --> 43:34.360
♪After rushing recklessly♪

43:34.568 --> 43:38.000
♪We approach each other♪

43:39.272 --> 43:42.880
♪Without turning back♪

43:44.264 --> 43:51.920
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

43:52.552 --> 43:59.040
♪Falling into you♪
